### scheduler-service — REST Admin API test data
### Xem testdata/README.md cho cách dùng file .http này.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8009
@oauthUrl = http://localhost:8004

### 0. Lấy token (client_credentials, mượn client nội bộ oauth2-service-internal)
# @name auth
POST {{oauthUrl}}/oauth2/token
Authorization: Basic oauth2-service-internal changeme-internal-client-secret
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&scope=webgw.internal

### 1. Tạo job ONE_OFF — SỬA "dueAt" thành thời điểm gần tương lai (vài chục giây sau "now") trước khi chạy
# @name createOneOff
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobName": "Smoke test - one off",
  "taskType": "SMOKE_TEST",
  "scheduleType": "ONE_OFF",
  "dueAt": "2026-09-16T12:00:00Z",
  "payload": { "note": "hello" }
}

### 2. Activate job vừa tạo — PENDING -> RUNNING
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs/{{createOneOff.response.body.$.data}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 3. Detail — xác nhận status=RUNNING, nextFireAt đúng dueAt
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs/{{createOneOff.response.body.$.data}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}

### Đợi tới sau "dueAt" ở bước 1 rồi chạy lại request #3 — status phải COMPLETED, nextFireAt=null.
### Xem log scheduler-service lúc đó: [IndexPoller] claimed ... -> [FireScheduledJob] fired: ... ->
### [ScheduledJobFiredHandler] fired (log-only, chưa outbox): ...

### 4. Tạo job RECURRING, cron mỗi 30s (Spring 6-field: giây phút giờ ngày tháng thứ)
# @name createRecurring
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobName": "Smoke test - recurring 30s",
  "taskType": "SMOKE_TEST",
  "scheduleType": "RECURRING",
  "cronExpression": "*/30 * * * * *",
  "timezone": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh"
}

### 5. Activate job recurring
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs/{{createRecurring.response.body.$.data}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 6. List — filter jobName (search substring, case-insensitive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs?jobName=smoke
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 7. List — filter status (exact match)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs?status=RUNNING
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 8. List — filter taskType (exact match) + phân trang
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs?taskType=SMOKE_TEST&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 9. Stop job recurring — idempotent, gọi lại nhiều lần không lỗi
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs/{{createRecurring.response.body.$.data}}/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 10. Edit — đổi jobName + cron (chỉ hợp lệ khi status != RUNNING, đã stop ở #9)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs/{{createRecurring.response.body.$.data}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobName": "Smoke test - recurring 1min (edited)",
  "scheduleType": "RECURRING",
  "cronExpression": "0 * * * * *",
  "timezone": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh"
}

### 11. Start lại sau edit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs/{{createRecurring.response.body.$.data}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}

### ── Test lỗi kỳ vọng (422 / 400 / 404) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 12. start khi đã RUNNING -> 422 SCHEDULED_JOB_INVALID_TRANSITION
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs/{{createRecurring.response.body.$.data}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 13. edit khi đang RUNNING -> 422 SCHEDULED_JOB_INVALID_TRANSITION
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs/{{createRecurring.response.body.$.data}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobName": "x",
  "scheduleType": "RECURRING",
  "cronExpression": "0 * * * * *",
  "timezone": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh"
}

### 14. thiếu jobName/taskType/scheduleType -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 15. id không tồn tại -> 404 SCHEDULED_JOB_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs/does-not-exist
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}

### ── Lookup / Danh sách (chạy độc lập, KHÔNG phụ thuộc phần tạo mới ở trên) ─────────────────────
### Dùng khi đã có sẵn job từ trước (không muốn tạo lại) — chạy request dưới để lấy id thật, thay
### {{createXxx.response.body...}} bằng id vừa lấy được rồi paste tay vào chỗ cần dùng.

### 16. List TẤT CẢ job, không filter (mặc định page=0, size=20)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 17. Detail 1 job theo id thật — sửa "<id>" thành id lấy từ #16
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scheduled-jobs/<id>
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.$.access_token}}
